ne/godot/pull/121981.patch","merged_at":"2026-08-03T19:26:59Z"},"body":"<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch. We will take care of backporting relevant fixes to older versions.\r\n\r\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for contributors:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\r\n\r\nUse of AI must be disclosed and should include a description of how it was used.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Closes #120576\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nIt turned out that the modern theme uses opacity for its colors but the plots in the profilers were setting the alpha to 1 when drawing background colors because the classic theme doesn't have colors with opacity.\r\n\r\nI followed the style of `AudioStreamEditor` for this fix. The color rects are added as the necessary layers for the transparent color blending.\r\n\r\nBelow is the Solarized Light theme comparison.\r\n\r\nClassic theme.\r\n\r\n| Profiler | Visual Profiler |\r\n|--------|--------|\r\n| <img width=\"1065\" height=\"468\" alt=\"godot windows editor dev x86_64_7u2BmQ4GOc\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b0145bb6-9d3d-458d-b863-f74130e58e1b\" /> | <img width=\"1069\" height=\"468\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b25bd613-c26a-4e19-a622-a2b70dbdd6aa\" /> |\r\n\r\nModern theme.\r\n\r\n| Profiler | Visual Profiler |\r\n|--------|--------|\r\n| <img width=\"1067\" height=\"464\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8766f674-9c66-4193-b094-2556e843a5be\" /> | <img width=\"1068\" height=\"462\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/66090b51-0efb-4818-b7e4-3adac796e2eb\" /> |\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121981/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121981/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}